{"step": 2, "unit": "rag-blueprint/eval/collect_pyvespa.py::feature_collection_first_phase_query_fn", "what_it_does": "Builds the Vespa query body for the first-phase feature collection, with nearest-neighbour clauses, query text, ranking and two embed inputs for the int8 and float query tensors.", "decisions": [{"label": "a", "lines": [95, 96], "verdict": "rejected", "why": "The embed() strings are evaluated server-side. The two keys feed differently typed tensors (tensor<int8>(x[96]) and tensor<float>(x[768]), base-features.profile lines 3-4), and the profile reads both. No Python edit fills both from one call. Step 1 listed lines 49-50 for this unit; the embed keys are at 95-96, and 49-50 belong to feature_collection_second_phase_query_fn."}]}
