{"step": 2, "unit": "visual-retrieval-colpali/src/backend/colpali.py::SimMapGenerator._prepare_similarity_map_tensor", "what_it_does": "Builds a zero float32 tensor of shape (maps, query tokens, patches, patches) and fills it with each Vespa summary cell at its token and patch position, skipping patches past the sequence length.", "decisions": [{"label": "a", "lines": [126, 160], "verdict": "accepted", "why": "The loop does one torch element assignment per Vespa cell, each with dispatch overhead. Repair: collect values in a dict keyed by (idx, token, row, col) with last-wins semantics, hoist the image_seq_length lookup, then write them with one index_put_. The output tensor, dtype and values are unchanged; out-of-range rows still raise IndexError. Only caller is colpali.py line 91."}]}
