{"step": 2, "unit": "visual-retrieval-colpali/src/backend/vespa_app.py::VespaQueryClient.format_q_embs", "what_it_does": "Converts a query-embedding tensor into a dict mapping each row index to that row as a Python float list.", "decisions": [{"label": "a", "lines": [204, 214], "verdict": "accepted", "why": "The per-row work is the enumerate comprehension calling tolist per row. Repair: for a torch.Tensor input, return dict(enumerate(q_embs.tolist())), keeping the old loop for other inputs. Same keys and values; a 0-d tensor still raises TypeError. Readers are query_vespa_bm25 and query_vespa_colpali, both in this file."}]}
