{"step": 2, "unit": "visual-retrieval-colpali/src/main.py::get_and_store_sim_maps", "what_it_does": "In a background thread, runs a second Vespa query for summary features, waits up to 5 seconds for the full images and writes one blended PNG per document and non-filtered token into SIM_MAP_DIR.", "decisions": [{"label": "a", "lines": [258, 294], "verdict": "rejected", "why": "Every non-filtered token gets a button that polls for its PNG, so the PNGs are needed for this search's UI. Deferring them moves work to the poll path and changes which files exist at search time, outside this unit."}, {"label": "b", "lines": [262, 268], "verdict": "rejected", "why": "The second query is a duplicate with an identical ranking, but removing it needs changes to get_fields, get_result_from_query and fetch_results in main.py, which is beyond this unit. A candidate for a cross-unit change."}, {"label": "c", "lines": [258, 294], "verdict": "rejected", "why": "An early return on existing outputs skips the Vespa query and the saved debug records, and cannot see index state; the query_id hash is salted per process, so reuse only helps within one process."}, {"label": "d", "lines": [270, 280], "verdict": "rejected", "why": "The 0.2 s sleep is off-CPU and bounded to about 25 wakeups per search. Changing the interval changes when maps appear, which the contract forbids."}]}
